ただけますと幸いです。\n\n◎資料\nTwitter\nhttps://x.com/lorazeparn?s=21\n\nGoogleドライブ\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1P4mBxNEIOCnBu9OYSH2lMsrLAuE6oQBP\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1P4mBxNEIOCnBu9OYSH2lMsrLAuE6oQBP", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}